# M14 "Pazar", flow "shop_homes" run 4 (PostgreSQL test database): "Burclu", raised to level 10 by vo_admin,
# hunts Anız Yanığı outside Tanyeri (`lootfarm`) until a Kızılca Şerbet dropped and was taken from a loot
# bag (PROTOCOL_SHOP.md §8.5: potions are loot like any item; the pickup line, the stack in the bag).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m14_homes
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars2 900
clickon select.slot0
wait 5
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+zone2+monsters 1800
expect world+level10
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene expectitem 16 = 0
scene lootfarm Anız Yanığı 16 1
waitfor world+farmdone 36000
waitfor world+alive 600
scene lootlog
scene expectitem 16 >= 1
scene movestack 16 5
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
key i
waitfor world+inv 60
hoveron inv.bag.5
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Kızılca Şerbet
expecttext inv.tooltip Tüketilebilir
screenshot 26_potion_from_loot.png
quit
